WEBVTT

00:06:27.135 --> 00:06:30.046
nese do te mund te thyenin disa norma

00:06:30.046 --> 00:06:34.650
te familjes e te shoqerise

00:06:34.650 --> 00:06:40.130
nese do te mund te shfuqizonin 
disa ligje diskriminuese

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:42.658
te sistemeve ne shtetet e tyre,

00:06:42.658 --> 00:06:44.949
te cilat shkojne kunder 
te drejtave bazike njerezore

00:06:44.949 --> 00:06:48.743
te gruas.

00:06:48.743 --> 00:06:53.987
Te dashur vellezer e motra, 
kur Malala lindi,

00:06:53.987 --> 00:06:56.140
dhe per here te pare,

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:57.414
besomeni,

00:06:57.414 --> 00:07:02.391
mua nuk me pelqejne femijet e porsalindur, 
te jem i sinqerte,